          "notes": "ShiftingVerificationHandler.HandleEvent filters source.module=counts + source.ref_type=shifting_event and calls Repository.BounceShiftingEventForRework, which returns the shifting_event 'pending_verification' -> 'authorized' (no relocation) so the operator re-records the video."
        },
        {
          "module": "feeddirection",
          "file": "backend/internal/feeddirection/app/feed_distribution_verification_handler.go",
          "notes": "FeedDistributionVerificationHandler.HandleEvent filters source.module=feed + source.ref_type=feed_distribution_completion and calls DistributionCompletionStore.BounceDistributionForRework, which returns the feed_distribution_completions row 'pending_verification' -> 'rework' (nothing completed) so the operator re-records the video + water proof and re-submits."
        },
        {
          "module": "tasks",
          "file": "backend/internal/tasks/app/event_handlers.go",
          "notes": "DeathVerificationHandler.HandleEvent filters source.module=counts + source.ref_type=workflow_death_signoff and calls Repository.BounceDeathVideosForRework, resetting both death video actions to 'rework' (proofs cleared, re-shoot mandatory) and the sign-off back to pending."
        }
      ],
